<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Qassim Cement Co Q1 pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Saudi Qassim Cement Co Q1 pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	     40.7   vs   32.9</p>
<p> Sales income		 38.7   vs   30.2</p>
<p> Expenses			2.5   vs    1.9</p>
<p> Other income		  4.5   vs    4.6</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds     710.7   vs  814.7</p>
<p> Assets			947.7   vs  942.2</p>
<p>Full Name: Qassim Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The company, one of eight cement firms operating in Saudi Arabia, is traded on the Saudi stock market.</p>
</text>
